# The dev stack's app site (P1.36b; ADR 0031 Decision 1, ADR 0032): https with the self-signed dev leaf (dev/tls.caddy)
# on the edge's newt_edge address only, which Pangolin reaches through Newt without verifying it (P1.37v); no published
# port and no :80 site. Its name and upstream are ADR 0025's app name and web, exact (readEdgeConfig's dev mode). Its
# own zones apply first, never pds-ratelimit; the sign-in files refuse writes; the client's address is dropped before
# web, as on every site.
{$APP_HOST} {
	bind 10.250.37.3
	import tls
	import access-log
	import security-headers
	import noindex
	route {
		import app-ratelimit
		import signin-files
		import upstream {$APP_UPSTREAM}
	}
}
